  "mcpName": "io.github.fpavia111-creator/fairtable-no-shows",
  "description": "Fairtable No-Shows: reservation no-shows from your OpenTable or Resy export: the no-show rate by day, guests who no-show again and again, large parties booked with no deposit and no-show fees your policy says to charge, with covers and sales lost. Guest details are masked for the AI model. Never charges a card or messages a guest.",
